TIMEFLOW_WEEKLY_WORK_HOURS = Weekly work hours
TIMEFLOW_WEEKLY_WORK_HOURS_TOOLTIP = Default number of work hours expected per week.
TIMEFLOW_MAX_ENTRY_DURATION_HOURS = Maximum entry duration (hours)
TIMEFLOW_MAX_ENTRY_DURATION_HOURS_TOOLTIP = Maximum plausible duration for a single time entry. Beyond this, creation or correction is refused; a timer left running longer is automatically split at midnight when stopped.
TIMEFLOW_MANDATORY_TASK_BEFORE_TIMER = Task required before timer
TIMEFLOW_MANDATORY_TASK_BEFORE_TIMER_TOOLTIP = Ask for a task before allowing the timer to start.
